{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "AGLedger silent-data-loss surveillance. Every panel here surfaces a failure mode that would otherwise be invisible in logs alone \u2014 non-zero rate is signal, investigate.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Bus events fired without a BUS_TO_PERSISTED mapping \u2014 they did NOT land in the events table. SIEM/webhook/federation consumers silently miss them. Non-zero = code path added without updating the map.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (busEvent) (increase(agledger_persist_event_unmapped_total{job=~\"$job\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{busEvent}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Unmapped bus events (1h) \u2014 agledger_persist_event_unmapped_total",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Parents the consistency sweep rolled up out of band (failed, or expired past their own deadline): every child terminal, at least one failed, no activity for five minutes, so the sweep rolled the failure up. Each one is an inline rollup lost to a crash or a dropped cascade job. Children never settle a parent, so a parent whose children all delivered waits for its own completion and never appears here. Read the GAP instead: stuck rising while repaired stays flat means those parents cannot be rolled up and needs a human. The sweep handles at most 50 parents per five-minute pass, so a large backfill drains at roughly 600 an hour and the two series close over hours rather than minutes.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(agledger_auto_rollup_stuck_parents_total{job=~\"$job\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "found due (1h)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(agledger_auto_rollup_repaired_parents_total{job=~\"$job\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "rolled up by sweep (1h)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "AUTO_ROLLUP swept vs rolled up (1h) \u2014 agledger_auto_rollup_{stuck,repaired}_parents_total",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Vault checkpoint creator skipped a record because verifyChain failed. Each cycle the record is skipped is one more cycle without a tamper-evident anchor.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(agledger_vault_checkpoint_skipped_broken_total{job=~\"$job\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "skipped (1h)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Vault checkpoint skipped (broken chain, 1h) \u2014 agledger_vault_checkpoint_skipped_broken_total",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "SIEM emission drops. HTTP: buffer overflow or post-close writes. File: stream errors or post-close writes. Customer's external SIEM has visibility gaps.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "max",
            "sum"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(agledger_siem_http_batches_dropped_total{job=~\"$job\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "siem_http",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(agledger_siem_file_lines_dropped_total{job=~\"$job\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "siem_file",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "SIEM event drops (rate) \u2014 http + file",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Does what leaves this Server arrive, and is anything permanently lost? `dead-lettered` is the one that matters: those jobs exhausted the pg-boss retry budget, so the peer will never receive that projection without an operator redrive from GET /federation/v1/admin/dlq. `post failed` is per-attempt and self-heals through retries, so a rising line there with a flat dead-lettered line is a slow peer, not data loss. `inbound conflict` counts peer projections that collided with a record already here (stale = ours won and theirs was discarded). Replaces a panel that queried agledger_federation_sequence_gaps_total and agledger_federation_sequence_reconciled_total, which no process has ever registered.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "max",
            "sum"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (increase(agledger_federation_outbound_post_succeeded_total{job=~\"$job\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "delivered {{kind}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (increase(agledger_federation_outbound_post_failed_total{job=~\"$job\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "post failed {{kind}}",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (increase(agledger_federation_outbound_retry_exhausted_total{job=~\"$job\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "dead-lettered {{kind}}",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (increase(agledger_federation_inbound_conflict_total{job=~\"$job\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "inbound conflict {{outcome}}",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Federation delivery divergence (1h) \u2014 health check",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Delegation parents waiting on their performer's own completion, every child terminal and the tree quiet for five minutes: at ACTIVE with none failed, or sent back for revision by the principal. Children never settle a parent, so each of these settles only when its performer submits the parent's own completion; one with a deadline expires if it never does, and one without stays ACTIVE until its performer submits or its principal cancels it. A few that come and go are performers mid-step. A count that only grows, or an oldest wait longer than your orchestrators should take, means a performer that does not submit the parent's completion. The worker logs the longest-waiting parent ids each pass; GET /v1/records/{id} on one shows the completion step in its nextSteps. With more than one worker replica, each pass runs on one of them; the queries read the replica that refreshed last.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byFrameRefID",
              "options": "B"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "text"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max(agledger_delegation_parents_awaiting_own_completion{job=~\"$job\"} and on(instance) (agledger_delegation_parents_awaiting_own_completion_updated_timestamp_seconds{job=~\"$job\"} == on() group_left() max(agledger_delegation_parents_awaiting_own_completion_updated_timestamp_seconds{job=~\"$job\"})))",
          "legendFormat": "parents awaiting own completion",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max(agledger_delegation_parents_awaiting_own_completion_oldest_age_seconds{job=~\"$job\"} and on(instance) (agledger_delegation_parents_awaiting_own_completion_updated_timestamp_seconds{job=~\"$job\"} == on() group_left() max(agledger_delegation_parents_awaiting_own_completion_updated_timestamp_seconds{job=~\"$job\"})))",
          "legendFormat": "longest wait",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Delegation parents awaiting their own completion",
      "type": "stat"
    }
  ],
